# Milestone 7 — Final-system CLI Verification Path

Establish a formal, deterministic, and observable regression path for testing the strategic cognition engine. This ensures that the simulation runs, produces canonical artifacts (replay + cognition graphs), and asserts structural invariants against them.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This milestone introduces `HeadlessRunner`, a new authoritative entry point for headless execution that will be shared between the `test_harness.py` CLI and all E2E regression tests. This prevents "test-path drift" where unit/integration tests diverge from real engine behavior.

## Proposed Changes

### Core Testing Infrastructure

#### [NEW] [headless_regression_runner.py](file:///home/vboxuser/Work/rpg-based-simulation/src/testing/headless_regression_runner.py)
A reusable service for executing headless simulations.
- **Isolate Environment**: Automatically disables Kafka, Redis, and metrics to prevent side-effects.
- **Authoritative Execution**: Uses the real `EngineManager` and `WorldLoop`.
- **Artifact Management**: Manages `ReplayRecorder` and `EntityCognitionExporter` lifecycle during the run.
- **Manifest Output**: Returns a structured `RunResult` containing paths to artifacts and summary metadata.

#### [NEW] [assertions.py](file:///home/vboxuser/Work/rpg-based-simulation/src/testing/assertions.py)
Structural assertion helpers for artifacts.
- `assert_graph_integrity(graph)`: Checks for dangling edges, missing roots, and sorted IDs.
- `assert_strategic_consistency(replay, graphs)`: Ensures replay state and cognition graph state are semantically aligned.
- `assert_determinism(result_a, result_b)`: Performs byte-identical or structural comparison of outcome artifacts.

---

### Integration & CLI

#### [MODIFY] [test_harness.py](file:///home/vboxuser/Work/rpg-based-simulation/scripts/test_harness.py)
Refactor the CLI harness to use `HeadlessRunner`. This ensures that manual CLI runs and automated regression tests share the exact same execution logic.

---

### Regression Test Suite

#### [NEW] [test_strategic_regression.py](file:///home/vboxuser/Work/rpg-based-simulation/tests/e2e/test_strategic_regression.py)
A formal E2E test suite using the new runner.
- **Determinism Test**: Verifies that re-running with the same seed produces the same artifacts.
- **Consistency Test**: Verifies that the exported graph correctly reflects the strategic state seen in the replay.
- **Continuity Scenario**: A simple scenario ensuring a project persists for at least N ticks without being dropped.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- **Unit Tests**:
    - `tests/core/test_cognition_graph_schema.py`: Validate serialization and ID generation.
    - `tests/core/test_cognition_graph_exporter.py`: 
        - Verify empty state export.
        - Verify project/objective linkage.
        - Verify interruption edge generation.
        - Verify non-mutation of the entity.
- **Integration Tests**:
    - Add a test case to the regression suite that runs a simulation for N ticks and asserts that the cognition graph export exists and matches structural invariants.

### Manual Verification
- Run CLI export for a target entity and verify the JSON output structure against the Cytoscape format.
